2026-09-12T09:05:09.9410639Z > # CRAN guard
2026-09-12T09:05:09.9410943Z > #
2026-09-12T09:05:09.9411376Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
